  sizes and decoded sample timing are unchanged.
- The project's backend/native/ggmorse_bridge.cpp accepts only the same
  8-192 kHz input range as its safe Rust owner. That owner supplies at most
  100 ms per call. The bridge is project code, separate from these upstream sources.

Regression: tests/test_cw_bridge_bounds.py compiles the actual bridge and these
sources under ASan; backend/src/cw.rs retains decoding, noise and timing tests.
